 "description": "Convert a value between units of length, mass, data size, time, speed or temperature. Supported units: mm, cm, m, km, in, ft, yd, mi, nmi, mg, g, kg, t, oz, lb, st, bit, byte, kb, kib, mb, mib, gb, gib, tb, tib, ms, s, min, h, day, week, mps, kph, mph, fps, knot, c, f, k. Use for exact conversions instead of approximating.",
